      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "On paper looks a good dual between MONTJUIC MAGIC and AUXILIARY. MONTJUIC MAGIC (5) was runner-up here two back then found winning form ere last time, tracking the pace and drawing clear. In form and hard to beat again. Same goes for AUXILIARY (1) who was a winner fresh then runner-up latest, trying to lead throughout before MONTJUIC MAGIC got the better late. Speedy type drawn low and will take catching again. ITWASONLYAKISS (8) ran on hard fresh then has since placed here on Saturday. Close to a win and looks a leading player if on the quick turn-around. HEBEL (3) is better than last run and hard to fault if at his best. TELLEZ (7) drew the outside gate but was too smart here fresh on Saturday. On the quick back-up but has to be included.",
